      "Language": "rus",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Expert assessments of 537 case histories of patients with various coronary heart diseases made it possible to derive an algorithm for automatic choice of therapeutic and prophylactic measures. This approach was tested within the framework of the automatic system \"Cardioscreening\". It was shown that there was a good correlation between the automatic choice of therapeutic and prophylactic actions and the strategy of a skilled cardiologist."},
